abstract: >-
  An open, public map of formal languages and automata theory: topics, papers, authors and venues,
  with automatically assigned topics that carry a confidence and a provenance. Code under the MIT
  licence; data releases are intended to be published under CC BY 4.0. The Zenodo archive of a
  version holds the code and documentation; the data export is not part of it.
